Aan-I83vICZeQ3AWLUfTxvMo1XydwRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSX9_nQMKBYFxvmJXZ601tsnb7-8WVwX4z_ETZnPgyxyw&oe=6AFC6644"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1083918432800277", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210893_1083918439466943_4096975780482072563_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zm8ArktGOgUQ7kNvwGgSdNF&_nc_oc=AdpUaqMZY8dNBTQE8iNa8z1wwPd2HL5zjLgJO4-vwk9CNGVpb2ASJZbsweLN0k9ZdIA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSBi3Ppe4-gB4r10hPoPfzDFWpMEY3n1P0zhcG352q3VA&oe=6AFC7FAE"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "1441316176805782", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_1441316180139115_660872075344180481_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_xApp4TQzRQQ7kNvwEtEpCv&_nc_oc=AdpJUjvzKecqFzSDCHald03ZAa2CMxzMbVrBYBwPJ6haLJhiRWnSrJ1SZwPDkEI18y8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRJd6CbizKOO3uW2IYIzjE1qmcZ9Ppbjk63voqjKqJFsw&oe=6AFC6F4D"}, {"file_name": "8.png", "id": "1052888042643074", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001670_1052888055976406_3539002532750634157_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pa-Zob9h0hAQ7kNvwEiuAsG&_nc_oc=AdoyvK8e_UB6pZX1lqX_uNOvvP6He8koeFWeCQOsCYL4ykNvBIyXg5PX-x3ny7SrFJc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQRwthZBG9Nv-NA34AB-drWxge5vmf25wSI_xRoKGoO0g&oe=6AFC6AE8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "2276308399239936", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982626_2276308402573269_1803063043453586688_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AwgLC54OXlUQ7kNvwF22hdN&_nc_oc=AdqNH1q6prKh-kkHWSpH-cbptFX4Ivn67wd-S-TMFv1Q-pflt225Qx0gxc6pUOXZQ6Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSqKJLs2j11d1s6qV0To4Zff-5jCefaTJ7sFE2ZnaIr7A&oe=6AFC7B73"}, "display_name": "Last Chance: The Survivor", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\"Last Chance: The Survivor\" is a VR-based action-shooter game that chronicles the gripping journey of Gabriel, starting as a scientist in an army laboratory and continuing as a father searching for his daughter in a post-apocalyptic world. Following a devastating catastrophe that has ravaged the world, Gabriel focuses on one sole purpose in his ruined life: finding his lost daughter. During this journey, Gabriel faces the challenges of a broken world, enduring both physical and emotional battles.\n\nFeatures:\n\nRealistic VR Experience:\nHigh-quality graphics and fluid VR mechanics for an immersive post-apocalyptic experience. Interact naturally with a world full of interactive objects and realistic physics.\n\nStrategic Combat:\nDiverse weapons for varied strategies. Defeat enemies using environmental tactics and smart resource management.\n\nDiverse Zombies:\nFace different types of zombies, each requiring unique combat approaches. From swift attackers to more formidable foes, adapt your strategy to survive.\n\nHighscore Mode:\nEndless action in Highscore Mode. Aim for high scores against increasing zombie waves. Tests shooting skills, quick thinking, and agility.\n\nVersions: \n1.0.3 - 'Highscore' and 'Training' modes are currently playable. New modes coming soon! Thanks for your feedback and support! ", "short_description": "Last Chance: The Survivor is a VR-based action-shooter game that chronicles the gripping journey of Gabriel, starting as a scientist in an army laboratory and continuing as a father searching for his daughter in a post-apocalyptic world. Following a devastating catastrophe that has ravaged the world, Gabriel focuses on one sole purpose in his ruined life: finding his lost daughter. During this journey, Gabriel faces the challenges of a broken world, enduring both physical and emotional battles."}]}, "developer_name": n